5,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"Since it's the first day, we have no information. I suggest we all share our general approach to the game so we can spot any inconsistencies later. Does anyone have a specific strategy they usually follow?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,May,,"That sounds a bit too formal, Asuka! I prefer to go with the flow and see who gets nervous. Let's just keep it lively and see who's hiding something. What about you, Rin?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,I'm with May! Let's make it a game! I'll be watching everyone's faces really closely to see who's acting weird. I'm super good at spotting secrets! Hehe!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minako,,"I agree with Asuka that a consistent approach is helpful, but May and Rin's intuition can be useful too. Let's observe each other's behavior and logic carefully. I will focus on the facts as they emerge.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Strategies are fine, but intuition is often just a guess. I'll be observing the logic behind your claims. Let's see who tries too hard to lead the conversation.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, observing the logic is a sound approach. However, relying solely on intuition, as May and Rin suggest, can be dangerous. We need a balance of objective evidence and behavioral analysis to find the werewolf.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're so serious! A little bit of danger makes it exciting, doesn't it? Besides, the ""objective evidence"" usually comes from the Seer, and we don't know who that is yet. Let's just have some fun!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, you're acting like a teacher! But May is right, the Seer is the real mystery. I wonder who it is? Maybe I can guess just by looking at you all! This is so exciting!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minako,,"While the excitement is fine, we shouldn't forget that the Werewolf is among us. Let's maintain a level of caution. If anyone has a specific pattern they usually follow when they are the Werewolf, feel free to share.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, asking the Werewolf to reveal their patterns is a bit optimistic, don't you think? They aren't going to help us. I'll be more interested in who tries to deflect that question.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your point is valid. The Werewolf will naturally hide their patterns. However, the way people react to such questions can be telling. I'll be paying close attention to the contradictions in everyone's logic.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're still in teacher mode! It's almost cute. But if we spend all our time analyzing ""logic,"" we might miss the real clues. I'm just going to enjoy the show and see who cracks first!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, right?! It's like a detective movie! I bet the Werewolf is getting all sweaty and nervous right now because we're talking about them! Hehe, I can almost see the clues floating around!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is high, but let's not let it cloud our judgment. We should remain composed. Since we have no data yet, I suggest we use the remaining time to establish a baseline for everyone's speaking style.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"A baseline is a reasonable request, Minako. I've already noted that Asuka is overly structured and Rin is predictably erratic. I'll be watching to see if those personas shift once the first death occurs.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Asuka,,"I accept that observation, Shion. My structure is simply my way of ensuring we don't overlook anything. I'll be watching for any sudden shifts in behavior as well. Let's see what the first night reveals.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,May,,"I'm just getting warmed up! Let's see who the Seer picks and who gets a little too quiet tonight. Good luck everyone, try not to miss me too much if I'm the one gone!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm not gonna be the one gone! I'm too lucky for that! I'll be dreaming of clues and secrets all night long. Goodnight everyone, see you tomorrow!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Minako,,I believe we have established a sufficient baseline for today. Let us proceed to the first night with a clear mind. I look forward to seeing how the situation evolves tomorrow.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Shion,,It's a simple start. I've seen enough for now. Let's see if the reality of tomorrow matches the masks you've all put on today. Goodnight.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
