36,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"The first night has passed. Since we now have a starting point, I want to see if anyone's demeanor has changed. @May, @Rin, you were very energetic yesterday; are you still feeling that way today?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,May,,"Of course I am! Why wouldn't I be? If anything, I'm even more excited now that the game has actually started. Did you expect me to be shaking in my boots, Asuka? How boring!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm still super excited! I woke up and immediately wondered who the Seer checked! @Asuka, you're still asking the same kinds of questions. Are you trying to trick us into saying something weird? Hehe!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, your approach is consistent, which is helpful for the baseline we discussed. However, we should now focus on whether anyone is acting out of character or attempting to steer the conversation too aggressively.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, your persistence is almost mechanical. It's a good mask, but it's also very easy to read. I'm more curious if the Seer has something to share, or if they're playing it safe for now.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, my consistency is not a mask, but a method. As for the Seer, revealing themselves too early can be a risk, but withholding information can also be a detriment. I'm curious if anyone else has noticed any discrepancies.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're still so focused on ""methods""! It's almost a crime. I haven't seen any discrepancies yet, but maybe the Werewolf is just as ""consistent"" as you are. @Shion, you're awfully eager for the Seer to speak. Why the rush?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@May, that's a great point! Maybe the Werewolf is just pretending to be a robot like Asuka! Hehe! @Shion, are you the Seer? Tell us, tell us! Or are you just trying to find them?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, please refrain from pressuring others to reveal their roles. If the Seer is among us, they will speak when it is strategically sound. Let's focus on the current dialogue and see if anyone is avoiding specific questions.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Rin, your eagerness is as predictable as ever. I'm not in a rush; I'm simply testing the waters. If the Seer is silent, it tells me as much about the group's tension as a reveal would.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@May, @Rin, your attempts to label me as a ""robot"" or ""teacher"" are distractions. Let's return to the logic. @Shion, you claim to be testing the waters, but you've been very focused on my behavior. Is there a reason for that?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,May,,"@Asuka, you're just so easy to tease! But you're right, Shion is being awfully focused on you. Maybe he's just obsessed? Or maybe he's trying to pin something on you to look innocent himself! What do you think, Shion?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@May, you're so smart! Maybe Shion is trying to make Asuka look like the bad guy so he can hide in the shadows! Hehe! @Shion, are you the Werewolf? You're acting all mysterious!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, @May, please stop speculating without evidence. @Shion, you have been analyzing others' masks since Day 0. If you are not the Seer, your focus on Asuka's behavior seems designed to create a target. What is your actual goal?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May"",""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, my goal is simple: efficiency. Asuka's rigidity is the easiest point of failure to monitor. If she slips, it's a signal. If I'm creating a target, it's only to see who rushes to defend her.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, your ""efficiency"" is starting to look like a calculated attempt to isolate me. Since I know you are human, I can say with certainty that your focus on me is a distraction. We should look at who is benefiting from this.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,May,,"@Asuka, wait, you just said you ""know"" Shion is human! How is that possible? Unless you're the Seer and you checked him last night? Now we're getting somewhere! This is getting so spicy!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, wow! Did you just let a secret slip?! Are you the Seer? Tell us, tell us! If you're the Seer, then Shion is a good guy, and we can look for the Werewolf together! Hehe!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Minako,,"@Asuka, you just made a very significant claim. If you are the Seer and have confirmed Shion is human, please state it clearly. If it was a slip of the tongue or a mistake, you must explain how you reached that conclusion.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Asuka, that was a clumsy slip. Either you're the Seer and you're terrible at hiding it, or you're the Werewolf trying to buy my trust by ""confirming"" me. Which one is it?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
