68,2,1,talk,May,,"Oh my, what a dramatic turn of events! Asuka was so sure of herself, and then she just... slipped? Poor thing. But wait, Shion is gone too! Who could have been so mean to our resident logic expert?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Wow, two people gone in one day! That's so scary! @May, do you think the Werewolf was scared of Shion's big brain? He was always poking at everyone, so maybe he finally poked the wrong person! Hehe!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@May, @Rin, let's stay focused. Asuka's execution was based on her suspicious claim, but Shion's death is the more critical piece of data. The Werewolf viewed Shion as a threat. This suggests the Werewolf is someone Shion was pressuring.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin"",""Asuka"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minako, that's a very serious way of looking at it! But Shion was pressuring almost everyone, wasn't he? Especially Asuka, but she's already gone. Maybe the Werewolf just wanted to shut him up before he figured everything out!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Minako, that's a scary way to think about it! But maybe the Werewolf just didn't like Shion's mean comments! Hehe! @May, who do you think is the most ""scary"" person left? I'm too small to be the Werewolf!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, size and personality are irrelevant. We must look at the behavior. @May, you were very quick to point out Asuka's slip. While observant, you and Rin have spent most of the time distracting us with jokes. Is that a tactic?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minako, you're so cold! I'm just trying to keep the mood light while we're all terrified. If I were the Werewolf, wouldn't I be acting more ""serious"" to blend in with you? I'm just being myself!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Minako, that's not fair! I'm just being me! Being happy isn't a tactic, it's just fun! Maybe the Werewolf is the one acting all cold and serious so we don't notice them! Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, being serious is not a tactic; it is a necessity for survival. If we rely on ""fun,"" we will lose. @May, your claim that a Werewolf would act serious to blend in is a common deflection. Who among us is actually the Seer?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,4,talk,May,,"@Minako, you're putting me on the spot! I'm just a girl who likes a good show. If the Seer is still here, they're probably terrified of being eaten next. Maybe they're hiding in plain sight, just like you!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Minako, you're being a big meanie! Why are you always questioning us? Maybe you're the Werewolf and you're trying to make us look suspicious so you can win! Hehe, that would be a super sneaky trick!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Rin, accusations without evidence are merely noise. I am simply analyzing the remaining players. Since Asuka and Shion are gone, the Werewolf is either May or you. I will vote based on who is less helpful to the village.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka"",""Shion"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
